his odd/terrible chat auto moderator that will ban you for one week for odd things such as having 212 in a sentence or using random words.\n\nFinal Verdict 5.5/10", "timestamp_created": 1527107786, "timestamp_updated": 1527107786, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42200003", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042645070", "personaname": "Kami O.o", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MasterKebabRemover/", "num_games_owned": 530, "num_reviews": 78, "playtime_forever": 323047, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 213264, "last_played": 1761924414, "avatar": "206c167e4f38530d5d7fc606e519438460f443db"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game has a lot of replayability value... All at the cost of 0$ !\n\nOnly 2 things that kept me invested in warframe for so long is the friendships i've made over the time and the fact that I can literally become rich in platinum without spending a single bit of my irl money.\n\nthe real question you have to ask yourself before you start playing warframe is \"Am I ready to invest a lot of time and effort into this game?\"\nbut the problem isn't not being interested in warframe, the new-player experience feels very empty and there is no information for new players to keep them playing for longer than a few hours. But once you discover the hidden information you just can't stop playing and Warframe just becomes an addiction that you can't stop. please send help, I dont know how much longer i can endure this addiction.", "timestamp_created": 1527107512, "timestamp_updated": 1542842758, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 15, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.6589546799659729", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42199938", "author": {"steamid": "76561198122260129", "personaname": "opman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/opman888/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 16018, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 46, "last_played": 1628197536, "avatar": "e7d3199aa42545fe718ebeb38c3a01fca0a33ccd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Eyy this game is more for people who like grinding games otherwise you wont like it . Great graphics even tho it is old as hell .", "timestamp_created": 1527107230, "timestamp_updated": 1527107230, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42199307", "author": {"steamid": "76561198168709934", "personaname": "BB99", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198168709934/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 809, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 193, "last_played": 1565473639, "avatar": "4c2fc799e501f21f136181462ffdb822b99f4ff3"}, "language": "english", "review": "boring game \n", "timestamp_created": 1527104548, "timestamp_updated": 1527104548, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.378944545984268188", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}